---
import type { Lang } from "../../lib/i18n";
import { local } from "./shared";
interface Props {
  lang: Lang;
}
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const t = local(lang);
---

<section data-demo="azure-repos" lang={lang}>
  <header>
    <p>
      {t(
        "Facility booking · Azure DevOps Git example",
        "시설 예약 · Azure DevOps Git 예시",
        "施設予約 · Azure DevOps Gitの例",
      )}
    </p>
    <h2>
      {t(
        "Set the gate before the merge.",
        "병합 전에 관문 설정",
        "マージの前に関門を設定",
      )}
    </h2>
  </header>
  <div class="approach" data-pr>
    <b>
      PR / <code>booking-conflict</code>
    </b>
    <p>
      {t(
        "Proposed fix: prevent overlapping room bookings",
        "수정 제안: 회의실 중복 예약 방지",
        "変更案：会議室の重複予約を防ぐ",
      )}
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="gate" data-policies>
    <h3>
      {t(
        "Required policies on main · example settings",
        "main의 필수 정책 · 예시 설정",
        "mainの必須ポリシー · 例の設定",
      )}
    </h3>
    <div class="requirements">
      <div>
        <b>01</b>
        <span>{t("Reviewer approval", "검토자 승인", "レビュアーの承認")}</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <b>02</b>
        <span>{t("Build validation", "빌드 검증", "ビルド検証")}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="blocked" data-blocked>
      <strong>
        {t(
          "WAIT · booking test failed",
          "대기 · 예약 검사 실패",
          "待機 · 予約テスト失敗",
        )}
      </strong>
      <p>
        {t(
          "Fix branch → new validation → review",
          "브랜치 수정 → 새 검증 → 검토",
          "ブランチを修正 → 再検証 → レビュー",
        )}
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="main" data-result>
    <span>
      ↓{" "}
      {t("After requirements are met", "요구사항 충족 후", "要件を満たした後")}
    </span>
    <b>
      <code>main</code> · {t("Complete PR", "PR 완료", "PRを完了")}
    </b>
  </div>
  <p class="boundary" data-boundary>
    {t(
      "Policies must be configured; bypass permissions can override the gate. This diagram is Git, not TFVC, and does not choose the app’s runtime host.",
      "정책 설정이 필요하며 우회 권한으로 관문을 건너뛸 수 있습니다. TFVC가 아닌 Git 도식이며 앱 실행 호스팅을 정하지 않습니다.",
      "設定が必要で、回避権限があると関門を迂回できます。TFVCではなくGitの図で、アプリの実行ホストは指定しません。",
    )}
  </p>
</section>
<style>
  section {
    container-type: inline-size;
    background: #ebf3f6;
    color: #173f52;
    border: 1px solid #829eaa;
    padding: clamp(16px, 3vw, 32px);
    line-height: 1.5;
    font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  p,
  h2,
  h3 {
    margin: 0;
  }
  header p {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 650;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1.5rem;
  }
  .approach {
    padding: 18px;
    border: 1px solid #829eaa;
    background: #fff;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .approach p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .gate {
    border: 8px solid #285e77;
    border-bottom: 0;
    padding: 22px;
    background: #fff;
  }
  h3 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }
  .requirements {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 20px;
    margin: 20px 0;
  }
  .requirements > div {
    border-bottom: 3px solid #285e77;
    padding: 10px 0;
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .requirements b {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;
  }
  .blocked {
    border: 2px dashed #8b4634;
    color: #733a2b;
    background: #f9eee8;
    padding: 14px;
  }
  .blocked p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-top: 6px;
  }
  .main {
    padding: 18px 22px;
    border-left: 8px solid #285e77;
    border-right: 8px solid #285e77;
    border-bottom: 8px solid #285e77;
  }
  .main span {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .main > b {
    display: block;
    background: #173f52;
    color: #fff;
    padding: 16px;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }
  .boundary {
    margin-top: 24px;
    padding-top: 16px;
    border-top: 1px solid #829eaa;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  @container (max-width:460px) {
    .requirements {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .gate {
      padding: 14px;
    }
    .main {
      padding: 14px;
    }
  }
</style>
